- [ ] T079 [US1] Update ExpenseRepository to include billing cycle fields in queries in backend/src/models/ExpenseRepository.ts
- [ ] T080 [P] [US1] Add unit tests for billing cycle calculation in backend/tests/unit/BillingCycleService.test.ts
- [ ] T081 [P] [US1] Update integration tests to verify billing cycle assignment in backend/tests/integration/csv-import.test.ts

